{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time there was a Ukrainian, went to work, drank gorilka, ate bacon, but once our hero touched it with a gorilka and turned into a ball! The Ukrainian did not lose his head and rolled around the city, but he decided to fun. Now his goal is to steal gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man turned into a ball and you need to steal all the gas from the forest at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ability to be a ball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Philosophical hidden meaning of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can just roll a ball, and collect gas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can fall out of the map if you cross the boundaries of the game world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ability not to pay for gas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H - exit</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/758480?t=1763732103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/758480?t=1763732103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763732103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763732103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time there was a Ukrainian, went to work, drank gorilka, ate bacon, but once our hero touched it with a gorilka and turned into a ball! The Ukrainian did not lose his head and rolled around the city, but he decided to fun. Now his goal is to steal gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man turned into a ball and you need to steal all the gas from the forest at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ability to be a ball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Philosophical hidden meaning of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can just roll a ball, and collect gas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You can fall out of the map if you cross the boundaries of the game world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ability not to pay for gas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H - exit</p>","developers":["Nikita \"Ghost_RUS\""],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758480/header.jpg?t=1763732103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/758480/134335/d9646aa26bd7624f9bef97471f78fd834908c688/1751140974/dash_av1.mpd?t=1511559871","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/758480/134335/d9646aa26bd7624f9bef97471f78fd834908c688/1751140974/dash_h264.mpd?t=1511559871","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/758480/134335/d9646aa26bd7624f9bef97471f78fd834908c688/1751140974/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1511559871","id":256701598,"name":"Ukrainian ball in search of gas - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256701598/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1511559871"}],"name":"Ukrainian ball in search of gas","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":fal